{"text":"熙平二年四月十五日，比丘惠榮仰爲皇帝陛下、七世父母、所生父母敬造彌勒像一區。謶藉□，仰崇聖□□，含生同登□。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"惠榮","refId":null,"text":"惠榮","start":12,"end":14},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":32,"end":34},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"含生","start":48,"end":50}]}